# Data Api

## Pattern
- One file per resource in `lib/api/` (`get…`, `create…`, `update…`, `delete…`), typed inputs/outputs, no UI.
- Hooks in `hooks/` wrap them with {{TanStack Query}}: query keys from `{{lib/query-keys.ts}}`, `staleTime` set deliberately, mutations invalidate the keys they change.
- Authorization happens on the server / via RLS — never trust a client check alone.

## Never
- Call fetch/supabase directly in components
- build query keys inline
- swallow errors
